&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
